ated were punished, any who disagreed were repressed, and many disappeared without a trace into his numerous prisons.  All must be loyal to the crown or suffer dearly.  When he died without heir the crown was lost and his kingdom fell into chaos.","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"62248379f46ac13db54c41254c5b063a5417c3a02e1b107a2df2545dc33af18f","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"mod-tome/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua","source":"This crown was worn by the Halfling king Roupar, who ruled over the Nargol lands in the Age of Dusk.  Those were dark times, and the king enforced order and discipline under the harshest of terms.  Any who deviated were punished, any who disagreed were repressed, and many disappeared without a trace into his numerous prisons.  All must be loyal to the crown or suffer dearly.  When he died without heir the crown was lost and his kingdom fell into chaos.","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"半身人国王洛帕曾佩戴这顶王冠，他曾于黄昏纪统治着纳格尔大陆。那是黑暗的年代，国王通过最残暴的手段执行他的命令和法律。任何违背他思想的人都被严厉的惩罚，任何反对他的人都被无情的镇压，这些人大部分都无声无息的消失了——被关进了国王那不计其数的监狱里。所有人都必须表示忠诚或者付出昂贵的代价。他在没有子嗣的情况下死去，皇冠失踪的同时他的国家也陷入了混乱。","target_preimage_sha256":"62248379f46ac13db54c41254c5b063a5417c3a02e1b107a2df2545dc33af18f","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-5e69946bed52ed5a5cbc/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-5e69946bed52ed5a5cbc","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-5e69946bed52ed5a5cbc/manifest.json","observation_identity":"4b77ae9794393ae1c8a6900cd3ad87a9b9d02496b8438bcee827cecf3c039185","publication_commit":"5aef7d5a2b88923de0ba74f26031bff03c604034","result_sha256":"336a695c71b88f1bfeae4c9fa0d683b006e0f2b893eeb9887eaa95d417ec0b79","res